<section class="sec" id="faq" style="background:#fff">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">FAQ</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">The questions people actually <span class="serif">ask.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">If yours isn't here, a counsellor answers it on a 20-minute call.</p>
<div class="faq-wrap">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>I cannot draw. Can I still become a designer? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes. Graphic design is arrangement, type and colour, not illustration. The pen tool and the grid are learnable skills, and taste is built through structured critique, which this course delivers weekly.</div></details>
<details><summary>Will AI image tools replace graphic designers? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">They replace untrained ones. Clients pay for judgement: brief-reading, brand consistency and files that print. AI multiplies a trained designer's output, and we train exactly that combination.</div></details>
<details><summary>Which software will I learn? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Photoshop and Illustrator at professional depth, Figma and Canva Pro for modern workflows, and AI tools, Midjourney-class generation and Firefly inside Photoshop, as a disciplined pipeline.</div></details>
<details><summary>What does a designer earn in Kerala? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Junior designers start between Rs 2.5 and 4 lakh in-house or at agencies. Freelance changes the math: alumni bill per project, and Gulf and remote clients pay well above local rates.</div></details>
<details><summary>Can I freelance from home after this course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">That is a designed outcome. The freelance module covers pricing, briefs and client cycles, and your capstones are structured as client deliveries so you start with proof, not promises.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do I get a portfolio at the end? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">You graduate with three client-grade case studies, a curated Behance presence and presentation practice. Design hiring is portfolio hiring; the whole course is built backwards from that fact.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala and the GCC. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a job after the course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, and we will not pretend otherwise. We provide structured placement support, real introductions and freelance guidance, with support continuing six months after you finish.</div></details>
</div>
